 class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o kâfirlerle mukatele de edin <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"157\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 157.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 23.2 30.0 30.0 36.7 36.7 52.4 63.0 71.2 71.2 83.2 90.0 111.0 122.2 122.2 122.2 129.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 52.4 83.2 94.4 129.0 141.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> tâ ki fitne: mihneti şirk olmasın <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"192\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 191.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 30.0 46.6 46.6 53.3 53.3 53.3 60.0 60.0 80.3 80.3 90.7 97.6 97.6 97.6 106.6 114.0 129.7 140.3 148.6 148.6 160.6 167.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"129.7 160.6 167.3 175.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve din, hepsi Allah için olsun -Allahın kullarını başkalarına mahkûm tutan edyânı batıla, dini hak karşısında ızmihlâle düşsün, hak, hâkim olsun da fitne ve mihnetle kimse ma'budı haktan başkasına itaat ve inkıyada sevk-u cebredilmesin. Sûrei «Bakare» de bu âyetin bir nazîri geçmişti. Yalnız burada «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"31\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 30.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 9.8 16.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » var, orada yoktu, ona ve kezalik sûrei «Bakare» de « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"133\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 133.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 13.4 20.2 20.2 20.2 29.2 36.7 52.4 63.7 63.7 79.4 86.2 93.0 100.4 100.4 111.7 111.7 118.4 118.4\" y=\"25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"79.4 93.0 123.0\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » âyetine bak.</p><p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"109\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 109.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 23.3 31.4 39.7 46.4 46.4 53.3 69.0 69.0 79.4 79.4 86.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"31.4 39.7 86.3 93.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Bu kıtal üzerine -fitneden ve Allahdan başkasına tapmaktan- vaz geçerlerse<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"226\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 226.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.0 30.7 30.7 45.0 60.7 71.3 79.6 79.6 86.3 95.3 95.3 102.0 117.7 124.6 133.6 133.6 149.3 156.0 156.0 156.0 162.7 170.3 186.0 186.0 196.6 196.6 203.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.0 60.7 86.3 102.0 124.6 149.3 186.0 203.3 210.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> her halde Allah, amellerine basîrdir. Ona göre ecirlerini verir. 40.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"105\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 104.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 31.6 31.6 39.0 47.3 63.0 63.0 73.6 73.6 80.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"31.6 39.0 47.3 80.3 88.6\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve eğer ı'raz ederler -vaz geçmekten imtina' eylerler ise<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"86\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 86.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 31.4 31.4 40.4 47.2 47.2 56.2 63.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"40.4 63.0 69.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> siz de biliniz ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"146\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 146.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 37.6 44.3 44.3 51.7 51.7 60.0 75.7 82.6 82.6 82.6 89.3 96.7 112.6 112.6 123.0\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"60.0 75.7 112.6 123.0 129.7\" y=\"26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> muhakkak Allah sizin mevlânız, veliy ve nasırınızdır.- Binaenaleyh onların adavetlerinden korkmayın, Allaha dayanın <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"213\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 212.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 24.0 30.7 30.7 45.0 45.0 51.7 59.3 75.0 84.0 84.0 90.7 90.7 97.6 114.7 126.0 126.0 133.6 133.6 141.7 150.7 150.7 158.3 174.0 183.0 183.0 189.7 189.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"45.0 75.0 97.6 141.7 174.0 196.6\" y=\"20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o ne güzel mevlâ, ne güzel nasıyrdır. -Ki sahib olduğu zayi' olmaz, nusrat ettiği mağlûb olmaz.</p><p>Böyle biliniz ve öyle yapınız: </p>","y":0}